                "postDate": "2026-07-03T07:20:22.253Z",
                "rawMarkdown": "This leaderboard is calculated with approximately 29% of the test data. The final results will be based on the other 71%, so the final standings may be different.\n\n`You can assume the test sit is roughly similar in size`\n\n199 * 29% = 57.71 = 58 ids PBLB with 1 unique embryo_ids\n\n199 * 71% = 141 ids PVLB with (1 in PuB & 1 Unq = 2 unique embryo_ids)\n\nis my assumption!!",
                "content": "<p>This leaderboard is calculated with approximately 29% of the test data. The final results will be based on the other 71%, so the final standings may be different.</p>\n<p><code>You can assume the test sit is roughly similar in size</code></p>\n<p>199 * 29% = 57.71 = 58 ids PBLB with 1 unique embryo_ids</p>\n<p>199 * 71% = 141 ids PVLB with (1 in PuB &amp; 1 Unq = 2 unique embryo_ids)</p>\n<p>is my assumption!!</p>",
